# Generated native projects (managed / continuous-native-generation workflow).
# These are produced by `expo prebuild` during the EAS build, so they exist when
# EAS computes its verification fingerprint (post-prebuild) but NOT when the CI
# runner computes the fingerprint (pre-prebuild). Excluding them keeps the
# fingerprint identical on both sides. Native config still affects the
# fingerprint via the config plugins + native dependencies, which ARE hashed.
